CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'file->f_op != &fuse_dev_operations'
#312: FILE: fs/fuse/inode.c:1192:
+	if ((file->f_op != &fuse_dev_operations) ||
+	    (file->f_cred->user_ns != sb->s_user_ns))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

